{"about_the_game":"Roald Amundsen's House remains much as he left it when he disappeared in 1928. The story of one of the world's foremost polar explorers is preserved as if in a time capsule within the walls of his home located in Bunnefjorden, south of Oslo. Amundsen planned and prepared several of his greatest polar expeditions from this house including; the conquest of the South Pole in 1911, the traverse through the Northeast Passage in 1918\u20131925 and the first overflight of the North Pole in 1926.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/1c03b9f963ba08e4269fc53a566983c8.poster.avif?t=1613146734\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/1c03b9f963ba08e4269fc53a566983c8.webm?t=1613146734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/1c03b9f963ba08e4269fc53a566983c8.mp4?t=1613146734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>For the first time ever, you can immerse yourself in the famous explorer's house in stunning state-of-the-art photogrammetry and interact with objects from Amundsen's life and expeditions in virtual reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/0892cbe640b9c4fc74e1a18046a6e79f.poster.avif?t=1613146734\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/0892cbe640b9c4fc74e1a18046a6e79f.webm?t=1613146734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/0892cbe640b9c4fc74e1a18046a6e79f.mp4?t=1613146734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a photo-realistic recreation of a real-life location, captured in extreme detail and brought to life through spatial audio and interactions. A must-see for anyone with an inner explorer.<br><br>Roald Amundsen`s House is a part of Follo Museum - The Museums in Akershus (MiA).","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1435700?t=1613146734","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1613146734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1613146734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1613146734","categories":[{"description":"Tracked Controller Support","id":52},{"description":"VR Supported","id":53}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"Roald Amundsen's House remains much as he left it when he disappeared in 1928. The story of one of the world's foremost polar explorers is preserved as if in a time capsule within the walls of his home located in Bunnefjorden, south of Oslo. Amundsen planned and prepared several of his greatest polar expeditions from this house including; the conquest of the South Pole in 1911, the traverse through the Northeast Passage in 1918\u20131925 and the first overflight of the North Pole in 1926.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/1c03b9f963ba08e4269fc53a566983c8.poster.avif?t=1613146734\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/1c03b9f963ba08e4269fc53a566983c8.webm?t=1613146734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/1c03b9f963ba08e4269fc53a566983c8.mp4?t=1613146734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>For the first time ever, you can immerse yourself in the famous explorer's house in stunning state-of-the-art photogrammetry and interact with objects from Amundsen's life and expeditions in virtual reality.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/0892cbe640b9c4fc74e1a18046a6e79f.poster.avif?t=1613146734\" width=500 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/0892cbe640b9c4fc74e1a18046a6e79f.webm?t=1613146734\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/extras/0892cbe640b9c4fc74e1a18046a6e79f.mp4?t=1613146734\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>This is a photo-realistic recreation of a real-life location, captured in extreme detail and brought to life through spatial audio and interactions. A must-see for anyone with an inner explorer.<br><br>Roald Amundsen`s House is a part of Follo Museum - The Museums in Akershus (MiA).","developers":["Glitch Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Education","id":"54"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1435700/header.jpg?t=1613146734","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1435700/326960/190feeb6bc33d92c48e1de33e59633f8c3f0972a/1750988161/dash_av1.mpd?t=1605682227","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1435700/326960/190feeb6bc33d92c48e1de33e59633f8c3f0972a/1750988161/dash_h264.mpd?t=1605682227","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/1435700/326960/190feeb6bc33d92c48e1de33e59633f8c3f0972a/1750988161/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1605682227","id":256809698,"name":"Amundsen VR Trailer","t